1
00:00:00,462 --> 00:00:05,180
Search in the Deck. Apps, contacts,
sums and the web, as you type.

2
00:00:06,446 --> 00:00:08,311
Open the Deck, tap Search.

3
00:00:08,351 --> 00:00:10,836
Swipe in from the tab, then tap Search.

4
00:00:10,876 --> 00:00:13,639
The keyboard comes up,
ready for you to type.

5
00:00:13,976 --> 00:00:18,011
Work out a sum. Type a sum and
the answer appears as you type.

6
00:00:18,051 --> 00:00:20,454
Tap Copy result to copy it.

7
00:00:21,598 --> 00:00:26,826
Find an app. Type part of an app’s
name and it shows up. One tap opens it.

8
00:00:27,776 --> 00:00:33,145
Find a contact. Your quick-dial people
show up too, ready to call or message.

9
00:00:33,751 --> 00:00:38,580
Call a number. Type a phone number
and one tap opens the dialer with it.

10
00:00:40,198 --> 00:00:43,208
Search the web.
Anything else goes to the web.

11
00:00:43,248 --> 00:00:47,315
Pick a provider, or press Search
on the keyboard for your default.

12
00:00:47,751 --> 00:00:51,016
Close it. Tap anywhere
outside, or press Back.

13
00:00:51,056 --> 00:00:53,946
The Deck slides away
and the tab comes back.

14
00:00:54,962 --> 00:00:57,462
Up next: The long-press menu.
